<title>USA: A.H. Belo boosts stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>A.H. Belo boosts stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.H. Belo Corp said on Thursday it will increase its stock repurchase authorization to 13.6 million shares from 3.6 million.</p>
<p>Repurchases are expected to be made in the open market and in privately negotiated transactions.</p>
<p>The number of shares outstanding was not immediately available, but as of June 30, the company had approximately 42 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
